    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "cutting back doesn't really change the math though. even if i stop eating out or whatever, the rent is still high and the interest is still piling up. i look at my bank account and then i look at my life and it’s just... it's a deficit. i'm operating at a loss every single month. it's like i'm trying to fill a bucket that has a massive hole in the bottom. how am i supposed to see a \"way out\" when the numbers literally don't add up?",
